This product includes a JavaScript translation of RNNoise (https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/rnnoise,
mirrored at https://github.com/xiph/rnnoise), BSD-3-Clause, at commit 70f1d25. Translated files:
src/{denoise,rnn,nnet,pitch,celt_lpc,kiss_fft,parse_lpcnet_weights,dump_rnnoise_tables}.c and
src/{nnet_arch,vec,_kiss_fft_guts}.h, into rnnoise.js, fft.js and gemv.wat (vec.h's sparse_cgemv8x4 in
WebAssembly SIMD). The changes are listed in their headers. The copyright holders and the license are in LICENSE.

rnnoise.bin is RNNoise's default model (model_version 0a8755f8, rnnoise_data-0a8755f8….tar.gz from
media.xiph.org, trained by Jean-Marc Valin on the public datasets listed in upstream's datasets.txt)
in upstream's own weight-blob format, written by upstream's dump_weights_blob (src/write_weights.c)
built with the default configuration (DISABLE_DEBUG_FLOAT). It is distributed under the same
BSD-3-Clause terms as the RNNoise source it is compiled from.

This product includes a JavaScript translation of parts of DeepFilterNet
(https://github.com/Rikorose/DeepFilterNet) at commit d375b2d, dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0,
used here under the MIT License: libDF/src/lib.rs and transforms.rs (STFT framing, ERB filterbank,
feature normalizations) and DeepFilterNet/df/{enhance,deepfilternet3,modules,multiframe}.py
(enhance(), the lookahead shift, the ERB mask, the deep filter), into deepfilter.js.

